<title>UK: German Laender to launch 4.5 bln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>German Laender to launch 4.5 bln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group of German states will launch on Friday a 4.5 billion mark 10-year bond at a reoffer spread of 15.5 basis points over Bunds, the joint lead managers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The joint leads are: Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Bayern Hypo, DGZ Bank, LB Hessen-Thuringen, NordLB and SuedwestLB.</p>
